# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and edit. Do not put real secrets in this example file.
# No API keys are required: the engine uses public SEC, Nasdaq and Cboe data only.

# --- SEC access (required for any live SEC request) ---
# The SEC's fair-access policy requires requests to identify the caller: an application name PLUS a contact
# (email or URL), separated by a space. Use your own details; this file deliberately contains no real contact.
# SEC_USER_AGENT=<ApplicationName> <your contact email or URL>

# --- Storage (optional) ---
# Relative paths are resolved against the working directory (the CLI) or the project root (Settings).
# DATABASE_PATH=data/research.duckdb
